<% content_for :title, "Loneliness & Isolation Relapse Plan | Bipolar Sober" %>

<main class="relapse-plan-page">

  <section class="relapse-plan-hero">
    <div class="relapse-plan-container">
      <%= link_to "← ALL RELAPSE PLANS", toolbox_relapse_plans_path,
          class: "relapse-plan-back" %>

      <p class="relapse-plan-eyebrow">
        BIPOLAR SOBER / RELAPSE PLANS / LONELINESS &amp; ISOLATION
      </p>

      <h1>
        <span>JUST YOU</span>
        <span>AND YOUR</span>
        <span>LOUD BRAIN.</span>
      </h1>

      <p class="relapse-plan-intro">
        MY SOBRIETY PLAN FOR FEELING ALONE &amp; PULLING AWAY.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="relapse-plan-section relapse-plan-yellow">
    <div class="relapse-plan-container">
      <p class="relapse-plan-label">01 / MY EXPERIENCE</p>
      <h2>WHAT ALONE<br>FEELS LIKE.</h2>

      <div class="relapse-plan-copy">
        <p>[Write about loneliness, isolation, and the connection to alcohol for you.]</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="relapse-plan-section relapse-plan-black">
    <div class="relapse-plan-container">
      <p class="relapse-plan-label">02 / MY WARNING SIGNS</p>
      <h2>WHEN I START<br>DISAPPEARING.</h2>

      <div class="relapse-plan-grid">
        <div class="relapse-plan-box">
          <h3>WHAT I STOP DOING</h3>
          <p>[Write how isolation shows up in your daily life.]</p>
        </div>

        <div class="relapse-plan-box">
          <h3>WHAT I TELL MYSELF</h3>
          <p>[Write the thoughts that make reaching out harder.]</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="relapse-plan-section relapse-plan-pink">
    <div class="relapse-plan-container">
      <p class="relapse-plan-label">03 / MY CONNECTION PLAN</p>
      <h2>MAKE CONTACT<br>POSSIBLE.</h2>

      <div class="relapse-plan-grid">
        <div class="relapse-plan-box">
          <h3>MY FIRST PERSON</h3>
          <p>[Add who you can contact and how.]</p>
        </div>

        <div class="relapse-plan-box">
          <h3>MY BACKUP CONNECTION</h3>
          <p>[Add other people, groups, or support options available to you.]</p>
        </div>

        <div class="relapse-plan-box">
          <h3>LOW-PRESSURE COMPANY</h3>
          <p>[Write what connection can look like when you have little energy.]</p>
        </div>

        <div class="relapse-plan-box">
          <h3>WHEN I WANT TO DRINK ALONE</h3>
          <p>[Write your immediate drinking-urge plan.]</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="relapse-plan-script">
        <h3>A MESSAGE I CAN ACTUALLY SEND</h3>
        <p>[Write a message in your own voice asking for company or support.]</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="relapse-plan-section relapse-plan-purple">
    <div class="relapse-plan-container">
      <p class="relapse-plan-label">04 / IF I NEED MORE</p>
      <h2>MY NEXT<br>SUPPORT OPTION.</h2>

      <div class="relapse-plan-copy">
        <p>[Add your further support options, care contacts, and personal safety plan.]</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</main>